      "reasoning": null,
      "thinking": "Ty Lee is 2/1 with prowess not yet triggered, and I'm noting the opponent has five untapped lands that could pump Waterbender to 5/2 if I block it. My plan is to block Snowballers with Ty Lee, then cast Reversal afterward to leverage the combat trick.\n\
\n\
