      "thinking": "I'm checking the opponent's board: a 1/1 flying vigilance Momo and six lands, with five untapped after the tapped Gate, plus one card in hand. If I attack with my 3/3 Jailer and 1/4 flying Teo, Momo can chump either one but trades unfavorably against Jailer.\n\
